@{h1}Inline assembly block

Contents are treated as raw Z80N Assembly

<asm>             ::= "__asm__" "{" Z80N_Assembly "}"

The returned value should be placed in HL.

The nonterminal Z80N_Assembly is assumed to represent a block of valid
Z80N assembly code.
